section
  height: fill
  valign: bottom
  text "Every rule count is floored, so a box never ends in a stub of a line — the leftover becomes padding instead. That is line-partial: false, and sheet 04b shows what turning it on does."
    font-size: 6.5pt
    color: gray(0.5)
